  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocating effective alcohol policies in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has national coverage, and aims at establishing best practices in alcohol control and consumption reduction. With partners and networks, the project will be pressing for new policies and implementation of existing laws and better practices. The main targets are ministries and relevant government entities at all levels. The strategic partner SLAPA will be strengthened, and supporting a coordinated effort with government in countering increasing alcohol consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
